WEBVTT

01:25.720 --> 01:27.840
ADAPTED FROM THE LEGEND
OF KUNSHAN JADE BY TAN TIANYIN

01:34.680 --> 01:36.560
How did you become like this?

01:43.120 --> 01:44.600
That's who I am.

01:46.200 --> 01:47.080
I've never changed.

01:48.080 --> 01:49.800
It means nothing to you.

01:51.600 --> 01:53.400
But for us,
it's a matter of life and death.

01:56.520 --> 01:59.120
If it weren't for them
who are tied here today,

02:00.760 --> 02:01.840
it would have been us.

02:08.360 --> 02:09.400
I understand.

02:09.919 --> 02:12.280
You're a man on top.

02:14.200 --> 02:15.920
You don't understand how we are.

02:19.680 --> 02:20.640
I…

02:23.480 --> 02:24.440
I understand.

02:26.320 --> 02:27.680
You've suffered a lot.

02:28.520 --> 02:29.400
You'll never understand.

02:34.160 --> 02:35.520
We're not the same.

02:41.120 --> 02:42.120
Someone.

02:44.240 --> 02:45.080
Beat them.

02:57.080 --> 02:58.040
Tomorrow…

03:02.000 --> 03:03.480
I'll find another place to stay tomorrow.

03:26.720 --> 03:27.720
Let's go.

03:29.280 --> 03:30.280
Hurry.

03:30.360 --> 03:31.400
Hurry.

03:34.640 --> 03:36.160
-This way.
-Where are we?

03:44.200 --> 03:45.560
There is a secret room.

03:48.440 --> 03:50.400
So many treasures.

03:51.720 --> 03:54.080
The master never miscalculates.

03:54.160 --> 03:55.200
He left a way out.

03:55.800 --> 03:57.800
Great. The trade caravan can be saved.

03:57.880 --> 04:00.160
With cash, we can participate
in the official auction.

04:00.240 --> 04:01.240
Yes.

04:01.320 --> 04:03.080
We must take back
all the trade caravan's belongings.

04:03.160 --> 04:05.920
But everyone knows now
what's going on with the trade caravan.

04:06.000 --> 04:08.040
I think they will try every means
to undercut us.

04:10.040 --> 04:11.080
Yeah.

04:13.440 --> 04:15.160
Steward Zhao, go to Zhuobao Jewelry Shop.

04:15.240 --> 04:17.880
I don't think they'll underpay us.

04:18.480 --> 04:20.000
But we need to surrender
part of our profits. Okay?

04:21.480 --> 04:22.640
But…

04:22.720 --> 04:24.120
I don't think Zhuobao Jewelry Shop

04:24.200 --> 04:25.720
can buy all these things.

04:28.360 --> 04:29.280
Yeah, they can't.

04:36.160 --> 04:37.720
You and Wei Yan go bid.

04:38.240 --> 04:40.640
Remember, I want

04:41.960 --> 04:42.920
all those pearls.

04:43.000 --> 04:44.800
If you'd handled it last night,

04:46.200 --> 04:47.640
it wouldn't be like this today.

04:48.560 --> 04:50.840
I could have made a deal
with the merchants from the South Sea.

04:50.920 --> 04:52.480
It's far from enough.

04:55.080 --> 04:56.200
They don't have to buy them all.

04:58.080 --> 04:59.600
As long as we can get enough money
to participate in the official auction.

05:01.360 --> 05:02.520
Just have a look?

05:03.480 --> 05:06.320
What to see?
See how the merchants in Guangzhou

05:06.400 --> 05:08.280
divide the Yan's assets?

05:10.880 --> 05:12.280
Use the Yan's money

05:12.800 --> 05:14.240
to buy the Yan's trade caravan's things.

05:14.920 --> 05:15.760
Is it reasonable?

05:15.840 --> 05:16.880
Um…

05:18.120 --> 05:19.400
Isn't that how it is now?

05:21.440 --> 05:22.440
I don't believe it.

05:24.600 --> 05:25.440
Wait.

05:31.640 --> 05:32.960
I have given the blood pearl to Duanwu

05:33.040 --> 05:34.680
and urged her to leave the trade caravan.

05:35.200 --> 05:36.520
But she wouldn't leave.

05:36.600 --> 05:39.120
She also found out
that Pang Song and Cao Da

05:39.200 --> 05:40.320
stole the trade caravan's jewelry.

05:41.200 --> 05:42.360
She lured them out.

05:44.000 --> 05:46.000
I've kicked them out of the trade caravan.

05:48.480 --> 05:49.440
Good.

05:50.360 --> 05:51.920
She learned to be patient.

05:53.680 --> 05:55.720
The Cui family has been raising money
all over Yangzhou.

05:55.800 --> 05:57.400
They even sold their stores.

05:57.480 --> 05:59.440
They are determined
to get the jewels sold by the government.

05:59.520 --> 06:01.200
The delivery date for the tribute pearls
is less than ten days.

06:02.440 --> 06:04.040
They will do anything for that.

06:05.280 --> 06:07.800
Duanwu wants to sell
the treasures in the secret room

06:07.880 --> 06:09.080
to participate in the official auction.

06:09.160 --> 06:10.840
Do you want me to warn her?

06:18.320 --> 06:19.160
No need.

06:19.760 --> 06:23.520
Are we betting too much this time?

06:30.800 --> 06:31.800
Remember to take your medicine.

06:59.760 --> 07:01.120
Master, careful.

07:04.760 --> 07:05.800
Father.

07:12.160 --> 07:13.960
Father. It's all my fault.

07:14.040 --> 07:15.840
See what you've done in Guangzhou.

07:15.920 --> 07:17.840
It's a big deal
that the tribute pearls were destroyed,

07:17.920 --> 07:19.200
but you hid it from me.

07:19.280 --> 07:21.480
Father, I wrote a letter to big brother.

07:21.560 --> 07:22.440
Even if you want to die,

07:22.520 --> 07:25.080
don't take the whole Cui family
down with you.

07:25.880 --> 07:28.160
Father, it's all my fault.

07:28.240 --> 07:29.480
I thought we could replenish

07:29.560 --> 07:32.280
the destroyed tribute pearls
to get the Cui family out of trouble,

07:32.360 --> 07:34.080
but I didn't expect Yan Zijing
to press hard upon us.

07:34.160 --> 07:35.000
Father, I--

07:35.080 --> 07:36.720
He's just a merchant
in the Western Regions.

07:36.800 --> 07:38.720
He's arrested, isn't he?

07:39.760 --> 07:40.800
Yes.

07:41.400 --> 07:42.360
Is there going to be an auction

07:42.440 --> 07:44.120
of Yan's trade caravan's property
tomorrow?

07:44.720 --> 07:46.440
-Yes. I--
-From Hepu to Guangzhou,

07:46.520 --> 07:49.000
he purchased pearls all the way,
but he didn't sell them.

07:49.640 --> 07:50.960
-Yes.
-Okay.

07:51.040 --> 07:53.320
Buy the pearls at all costs tomorrow.

07:54.360 --> 07:57.040
Father, I've dealt with Yan Zijing
so many times.

07:57.120 --> 07:58.280
He wouldn't get arrested easily.

07:58.360 --> 08:00.040
Now, all his property will be auctioned.

08:00.560 --> 08:02.480
There is something fishy about it.

08:02.560 --> 08:04.440
It has nothing to do with you anymore.

08:05.800 --> 08:07.520
Look at what you're wearing.

08:07.600 --> 08:09.080
You're a girl.

08:09.160 --> 08:11.280
You should do what girls do.

08:12.720 --> 08:13.920
Go home.

08:14.000 --> 08:15.160
Change your clothes.

08:16.960 --> 08:18.920
So what if I'm a girl?

08:21.120 --> 08:22.120
Father.

08:23.440 --> 08:25.000
Can't a girl do business?

08:25.080 --> 08:27.000
A girl does business?

08:27.520 --> 08:29.960
All you can do for the Cui family

08:30.040 --> 08:32.200
is to go back to Yangzhou
and marry the Zheng family.

08:32.280 --> 08:33.919
If I marry the Zheng family,

08:35.360 --> 08:36.760
who will help you?

08:37.960 --> 08:40.240
Are you counting on your loser sons?

08:40.320 --> 08:41.679
You.

08:42.720 --> 08:44.440
Go change your clothes.

08:48.920 --> 08:49.920
Father.

08:51.400 --> 08:52.600
I won't get changed.

08:53.640 --> 08:55.960
-Change them.
-I won't.

08:56.040 --> 08:56.960
Change them.

08:58.720 --> 08:59.920
I won't change.

09:00.920 --> 09:03.440
Master, please stop beating her.
Please stop.

09:04.040 --> 09:06.160
Lady Shijiu, stop talking back.

09:09.360 --> 09:12.600
-Send Lady Shijiu back to her room.
-Go.

09:15.280 --> 09:18.320
-Lady Shijiu, let's go.
-Get out of here.

09:23.440 --> 09:24.480
Master.

09:27.080 --> 09:29.640
Master, calm down.

09:30.480 --> 09:31.720
I have rented a house.

09:31.800 --> 09:32.880
Are we moving over now?

09:34.200 --> 09:35.040
Okay.

09:37.360 --> 09:39.200
What's wrong?
Are you still worried about Duanwu?

09:43.040 --> 09:45.040
I never really understood her.

09:45.120 --> 09:46.320
You are different.

09:46.400 --> 09:47.440
She's right.

09:48.080 --> 09:49.640
Everyone is different.

09:50.680 --> 09:52.760
Don’t judge
without being in another's shoes.

09:54.800 --> 09:55.840
It's my fault.

09:57.160 --> 09:58.640
Cui Jingchu has arrived in Guangzhou.

09:59.320 --> 10:00.320
Let's get down to business.

10:01.920 --> 10:04.280
Yan Zijing went from Hepu to Guangzhou.

10:06.040 --> 10:07.360
From the Mermaid Treasure Race

10:07.960 --> 10:09.720
to purchasing pearls
under the name of Feng.

10:11.600 --> 10:12.560
Every move he made

10:12.640 --> 10:15.080
was to force the Cui family to a dead end.

10:22.880 --> 10:25.920
The official auction is not that simple.

10:26.000 --> 10:28.480
These are
all Yan's trade caravan's belongings

10:28.560 --> 10:31.480
for this official auction.

10:32.080 --> 10:33.920
I'm Zhang Jinran, a chancellor of the
Institute for Advancement of Literature.

10:34.680 --> 10:35.960
I put the seals

10:36.040 --> 10:38.000
on these seized items myself.

10:38.840 --> 10:40.040
But this official acution

10:40.120 --> 10:42.360
is to raise money for the victims,

10:42.960 --> 10:44.040
not a commercial auction.

10:44.960 --> 10:47.560
So, this will be a blind auction.

10:47.640 --> 10:48.520
-Blind auction.
-Blind auction.

10:48.600 --> 10:49.520
Who dares to bid for it?

10:49.600 --> 10:50.560
It's something
from the Yan's trade caravan.

10:50.640 --> 10:51.920
-Blind auction.
-It's a bold auction.

10:52.000 --> 10:53.160
We don't even know

10:53.240 --> 10:55.720
what's inside.

10:56.960 --> 10:58.440
How can we bid?

10:58.520 --> 11:00.160
Yan's trade caravan

11:00.240 --> 11:01.640
is a merchant in the Western Regions.

11:02.680 --> 11:04.520
There are a lot of rare treasures
on their boat.

11:05.200 --> 11:07.960
Of course. These items are sealed.

11:08.040 --> 11:09.440
You can't know what's inside.

11:10.200 --> 11:11.600
Please,

11:11.680 --> 11:13.200
have a guess

11:13.280 --> 11:14.280
and make your offer.

11:15.800 --> 11:17.120
Alright then.

11:17.720 --> 11:20.280
Everyone knows
that the Yan's treasures are valuable.

11:20.360 --> 11:22.720
If you get them at a low price,
you're lucky.

11:22.800 --> 11:25.200
If you get them at a high cost, accept it.

11:26.600 --> 11:29.000
Let's make it easy.

11:29.560 --> 11:31.480
We'll count everything

11:31.560 --> 11:32.840
as one auction.

11:32.920 --> 11:34.880
The highest bidder gets it.

11:35.720 --> 11:36.560
Alright.

11:36.640 --> 11:38.040
Since it's a one-time deal,

11:38.120 --> 11:40.560
I'll bid three million maces.

11:42.640 --> 11:43.920
Three million maces?

11:44.000 --> 11:46.000
There are high quality emeralds
and Nanyang pearls

11:46.080 --> 11:47.440
of out trade caravan in these boxes.

11:48.720 --> 11:50.280
It's worth more than three million maces.

11:52.720 --> 11:54.600
We bid nine million maces.

11:55.200 --> 11:57.080
We bid ten million maces.

11:57.960 --> 11:59.520
Eighteen million maces.

12:02.320 --> 12:03.160
Father.

12:05.280 --> 12:06.280
We bid

12:07.840 --> 12:09.800
23 million maces.

12:09.880 --> 12:11.760
Twenty-three million maces.

12:11.840 --> 12:13.800
-It can buy a boatload of jewelry.
-The price is sky-high.

12:15.080 --> 12:16.880
The Yan's treasures
are of extraordinary quality.

12:16.960 --> 12:19.760
The Cui family collected 26 million maces.

12:28.800 --> 12:30.480
How big are the pearls in there?

12:33.000 --> 12:34.200
It's risky.

12:34.720 --> 12:37.320
-I'm not sure about it.
-Right?

12:38.080 --> 12:39.160
Yan's trade caravan.

12:43.480 --> 12:44.480
Twenty…

12:47.120 --> 12:48.480
five and a half million maces.

12:49.320 --> 12:50.440
Yan's trade caravan

12:50.520 --> 12:52.480
is buying their own things.

12:53.080 --> 12:54.200
The Yan's will lose a lot.

12:54.280 --> 12:56.200
Their master killed someone.
They deserve it.

12:59.880 --> 13:01.080
Father.

13:01.160 --> 13:02.640
I've dealt with them many times.

13:02.720 --> 13:04.480
They're not that simple.

13:04.560 --> 13:06.680
We should think twice.

13:06.760 --> 13:08.720
-Father.
-The Cui's.

13:10.080 --> 13:11.520
Twenty-six million maces.

13:11.600 --> 13:13.320
The price is sky-high.

13:13.920 --> 13:15.120
The Cui's is determined to get it.

13:16.440 --> 13:17.360
Okay.

13:18.720 --> 13:21.800
Does anyone

13:21.880 --> 13:23.560
want to bid more than 26 million maces?

13:24.480 --> 13:26.080
Duanwu. Make a bid.

13:26.160 --> 13:28.200
-Duanwu, what should we do?
-Otherwise…

13:28.960 --> 13:30.440
Yan's trade caravan.

13:35.240 --> 13:36.240
Yan's trade caravan.

13:40.480 --> 13:41.720
We abstain.

13:47.240 --> 13:48.320
Congratulations to the Cui's

13:48.400 --> 13:52.240
on winning all the items
in this official auction.

13:55.280 --> 13:56.440
Wait.

13:58.200 --> 13:59.120
Cui's.

14:00.360 --> 14:01.640
You haven't signed the contract yet.

14:08.280 --> 14:09.200
Father.

14:14.240 --> 14:17.160
CUI JINGCHU

14:44.160 --> 14:45.680
Lady Shijiu, open them.

14:45.760 --> 14:46.760
Yes.

14:50.120 --> 14:51.040
Father.

14:52.240 --> 14:54.360
Duanwu. You were right.

14:54.440 --> 14:55.680
The master was prepared.

14:58.120 --> 14:59.160
-Open them all.
-Yes.

14:59.240 --> 15:00.400
-Open them all.
-Yes.

15:06.560 --> 15:09.000
It's all junk.

15:09.080 --> 15:10.160
Um…

15:10.240 --> 15:11.320
The Yan's

15:11.400 --> 15:12.760
is specious.

15:14.240 --> 15:16.120
Good thing I didn't bid.

15:16.200 --> 15:18.320
The Cui's lost a lot of money.

15:18.400 --> 15:20.160
They spent 26 million maces

15:20.240 --> 15:21.320
on junk.

15:21.840 --> 15:24.240
What's the use of these? It's all junk.

15:29.440 --> 15:30.560
Look.

15:30.640 --> 15:32.040
There's nothing good.

15:37.640 --> 15:40.160
Master. It's all worthless stuff.

15:42.840 --> 15:43.840
Father.

15:44.360 --> 15:47.320
Um…

15:47.400 --> 15:49.160
Father. Father.

15:49.680 --> 15:51.080
Father. Father.

15:51.880 --> 15:52.800
Father.

15:52.880 --> 15:54.200
What a show.

16:00.720 --> 16:01.840
Yan Zijing.

16:02.880 --> 16:04.440
What are you doing here?

16:13.640 --> 16:14.680
Master.

16:16.040 --> 16:18.040
Seems like we came at the right time.

16:19.160 --> 16:20.160
Accountant Wei.

16:23.440 --> 16:24.440
Yan Zijing.

16:25.600 --> 16:26.840
It's you.

16:27.440 --> 16:29.680
I was arrested for killing Wei Yan.

16:30.600 --> 16:32.040
But Wei Yan is not dead.

16:32.120 --> 16:33.160
I was released.

16:33.840 --> 16:35.840
I didn't expect you to auction my stuff

16:36.520 --> 16:39.160
just after I was arrested.

16:39.240 --> 16:41.200
However, since Special Envoy Xu is here to

16:41.760 --> 16:43.400
confirmed the validity of the contract,

16:43.920 --> 16:44.880
I'll…

16:46.200 --> 16:47.400
take the deal.

16:50.240 --> 16:51.200
The contract is finalized.

16:52.040 --> 16:53.040
Cui,

16:53.680 --> 16:54.840
please make your payment.

16:55.520 --> 16:57.480
Congratulations, Mr. Yan.

16:57.560 --> 16:59.680
Not only did you have good luck,

16:59.760 --> 17:01.440
but you have also

17:01.520 --> 17:03.720
made a good deal.

17:05.240 --> 17:06.400
Special Envoy Xu, not at all.

17:07.680 --> 17:09.359
My stuff

17:09.440 --> 17:11.440
is worth a lot more than 26 million maces.

17:12.640 --> 17:15.280
But I accept it.

17:25.240 --> 17:26.359
Congratulations, the Cui's.

17:27.520 --> 17:30.200
Lady Shijiu.
I'd like to introduce someone to you.

17:32.040 --> 17:32.920
Mr. Shi.

17:37.400 --> 17:39.000
So this is Mr. Shi?

17:45.600 --> 17:47.240
My dear friend.

17:57.320 --> 17:58.960
Mr. Yan, what a good tactic.

18:00.120 --> 18:02.560
Now, even if there are pearls
in front of the Cui family,

18:03.320 --> 18:05.080
they can't buy them.

18:06.760 --> 18:07.760
I'm flattered.

18:08.280 --> 18:10.960
Mr. Zhang, thanks to you too.

18:11.480 --> 18:12.520
Are you satisfied

18:13.320 --> 18:14.240
with this result?

18:14.320 --> 18:15.640
The delivery date for the tribute pearls
is coming.

18:16.760 --> 18:17.800
The Cui family

18:18.320 --> 18:19.520
cannot escape this time.

18:21.000 --> 18:22.280
Make good use

18:22.360 --> 18:24.040
of this chance then.

18:26.560 --> 18:27.640
Mr. Yan.

18:28.640 --> 18:31.760
You make full use of every person,

18:32.280 --> 18:33.160
and you never miscalculate.

18:35.880 --> 18:36.760
Thank you.

18:39.520 --> 18:40.400
I'm afraid

18:41.520 --> 18:43.080
someone will not be able to sleep.

18:43.600 --> 18:45.560
Mr. Zhang, you'd better plan ahead.

18:46.480 --> 18:47.840
In case someone becomes desperate

18:48.560 --> 18:50.000
and hurts the innocent.

18:52.400 --> 18:55.640
Mr. Yan, thank you for the heads up.

18:56.160 --> 18:57.840
I had my plans

18:57.920 --> 18:58.960
before I got involved.

19:00.760 --> 19:01.720
You…

19:03.320 --> 19:04.520
Take good care of Duanwu.

19:08.840 --> 19:11.320
She's my person. I will take care of her.

19:13.560 --> 19:15.720
Care more about yourself.

19:19.600 --> 19:20.760
In that case,

19:21.560 --> 19:25.440
we can't let Zhang Jinran leave Guangzhou.

19:28.440 --> 19:29.400
Yes.

19:30.880 --> 19:33.040
Master.

19:35.600 --> 19:36.920
Wei Yan is fine.

19:37.920 --> 19:39.080
The matter has subsided.

19:39.600 --> 19:40.640
Everything is back
to the way it was before.

19:42.360 --> 19:44.720
Master, you're brilliant.

19:45.320 --> 19:48.360
Accountant Wei.
You kept it from everyone for so long.

19:48.440 --> 19:51.440
You did a great job.

19:53.080 --> 19:54.080
Reward her.

19:55.800 --> 19:56.840
Thank you, Master.

20:02.800 --> 20:03.880
Master.

20:04.400 --> 20:06.080
At the official auction,

20:06.160 --> 20:07.200
Steward Zhao

20:07.280 --> 20:09.240
did a great job.

20:11.720 --> 20:13.880
Steward Zhao, what reward do you want?

20:17.520 --> 20:18.760
Just say it.

20:22.000 --> 20:24.920
Master, I'm already old.

20:26.400 --> 20:29.760
I hope you'll agree to let me retire.

20:36.880 --> 20:38.160
Steward Zhao,
you've been traveling with me

20:39.080 --> 20:40.440
all these years.

20:42.040 --> 20:44.160
Even when the trade caravan
was in trouble,

20:44.240 --> 20:45.360
you never left me.

20:46.640 --> 20:47.720
I will never forget

20:49.240 --> 20:50.160
your effort.

20:50.760 --> 20:51.800
Master.

20:54.160 --> 20:55.040
Kang Ju.

21:01.560 --> 21:04.800
This is a shop in Yangzhou.
Steward Zhao, I'll give it to you.

21:05.400 --> 21:06.680
I hope you can go home

21:07.560 --> 21:08.480
and enjoy your retirement.

21:17.000 --> 21:17.880
Thank you, Master.

21:19.080 --> 21:19.960
You're welcome.

21:21.320 --> 21:22.560
-Great.
-Great.

21:22.640 --> 21:23.760
-Great.
-Great.

21:23.840 --> 21:25.080
Yan's trade caravan

21:25.160 --> 21:26.920
is always fair in meting out rewards
and punishments.

21:28.200 --> 21:30.440
This time, Duanwu did a good job.

21:31.480 --> 21:33.280
From now on,

21:33.360 --> 21:36.000
Duanwu is promoted as the assistant
of our trade caravan.

21:37.840 --> 21:39.560
-Great.
-Great.

21:39.640 --> 21:41.560
Duanwu is amazing.

21:46.080 --> 21:46.960
Thank you, Master.

21:47.480 --> 21:49.320
I'll do my best.

21:52.000 --> 21:53.320
However,

21:53.840 --> 21:55.160
we always hold on to

21:55.240 --> 21:56.960
the law of the jungle.

21:59.480 --> 22:00.480
Tell me about it.

22:02.320 --> 22:03.480
When did you notice it?

22:04.880 --> 22:06.160
You're smart.

22:07.280 --> 22:08.720
If you wanted to get rid of someone,

22:09.920 --> 22:11.440
you wouldn't leave so many holes.

22:13.640 --> 22:14.600
That's right.

22:16.120 --> 22:18.400
But this doesn't mean anything.

22:20.280 --> 22:21.480
What else?

22:21.560 --> 22:23.400
It was not a Nanyang pearl
in Shi Nawei's hand.

22:24.480 --> 22:25.560
It was a Hepu South Sea pearl.

22:26.320 --> 22:28.160
I've been collecting pearls
and dividing pearls since childhood.

22:28.240 --> 22:29.640
I know the differences
between Hepu South Sea pearls

22:29.720 --> 22:30.560
and Nanyang pearls.

22:30.640 --> 22:32.200
In Guangzhou,

22:33.080 --> 22:35.280
you have the most Hepu South Sea pearls.

22:36.240 --> 22:37.400
So, I guessed

22:38.600 --> 22:40.120
Shi Nawei was hired by you.

22:40.200 --> 22:42.080
You have a good eye

22:42.160 --> 22:43.080
and a good brain.

22:43.760 --> 22:44.800
Master, what do you mean?

22:44.880 --> 22:46.520
I'm complimenting you. What else?

22:47.440 --> 22:48.280
Complimenting me?

22:49.560 --> 22:50.760
What's wrong?

22:56.480 --> 22:57.800
But I was surprised

22:59.320 --> 23:00.720
that you trusted me so much.

23:01.320 --> 23:04.560
If I had sold
all your property and your jewels

23:04.640 --> 23:05.720
and left,

23:06.240 --> 23:08.360
you would have lost everything.

23:09.680 --> 23:10.800
I'm smart.

23:13.000 --> 23:13.920
You have a good eye

23:14.800 --> 23:15.640
and a good brain.

23:15.720 --> 23:17.800
If you want to say I'm an old fox,

23:17.880 --> 23:19.440
just say it.

23:21.000 --> 23:22.000
However,

23:22.080 --> 23:23.320
you can call me anything you want.

23:23.400 --> 23:25.760
Business is war without swords.

23:26.480 --> 23:28.200
Winner takes all.

23:29.160 --> 23:30.320
Got it?

25:24.840 --> 25:26.800
Master, you need to take your medicine.

25:28.480 --> 25:29.560
Master…

25:29.640 --> 25:31.360
You dishonored our family.

25:42.160 --> 25:43.000
Special Envoy Xu.

25:43.080 --> 25:44.360
Mr. Cui.

25:44.440 --> 25:45.480
Special Envoy Xu.

25:45.560 --> 25:49.240
Cui family's recent dramas
are getting more and more interesting.

25:50.240 --> 25:53.720
But you're still not handing over
the tribute pearls…

25:53.800 --> 25:56.360
How should this scene end?

25:57.320 --> 25:59.800
The Cui family has also
seen strong winds and waves.

26:00.480 --> 26:02.200
Trading is like a battlefield

26:02.280 --> 26:03.400
No general wins all the time.

26:03.480 --> 26:06.160
No merchant wins all the time too.

26:06.880 --> 26:09.640
It seems that Mr. Cui also knows

26:09.720 --> 26:11.320
there is no general who wins all the time.

26:12.040 --> 26:13.360
Well, in that case,

26:13.440 --> 26:15.040
Cui family

26:15.120 --> 26:16.920
shall admit that you've destroyed
the tribute pearls

26:17.000 --> 26:19.360
in the Pearl Tower fire.

26:19.960 --> 26:23.920
And also compensate for
the tribute pearls.

26:24.440 --> 26:25.920
Most importantly,

26:26.840 --> 26:29.600
finish the pearl lotus platform quickly.

26:29.680 --> 26:31.520
I would like to dedicate it to Lord Tan.

26:31.600 --> 26:35.200
Let Lord Tan make the mediation.

26:35.720 --> 26:37.160
To prevent the Royal Court
from finding faults

26:37.240 --> 26:39.320
with the Cui family.

26:39.920 --> 26:42.040
Cui family is severely damaged this time.

26:42.640 --> 26:45.280
In order to raise tribute pearls,
I have sold a few shops.

26:46.000 --> 26:47.560
But this huge compensation…

26:48.480 --> 26:50.120
It's going to be tough.

26:54.840 --> 26:57.800
Mr. Cui.

26:59.160 --> 27:01.840
You're already in big trouble, Mr. Cui.

27:02.640 --> 27:05.240
Why are you still thinking
about your wallet?

27:05.320 --> 27:10.000
Now that Zhang Jinran
has got the Cui family's ledger,

27:10.080 --> 27:12.000
even if he doesn't do anything,

27:12.080 --> 27:14.560
as long as you can't
hand over tribute pearls,

27:14.640 --> 27:17.280
he will make a thorough investigation
of this case.

27:17.360 --> 27:19.560
Don't talk about money bags then.

27:20.080 --> 27:22.240
Everyone in Cui family.

27:22.840 --> 27:24.200
Not one of them will survive.

27:25.920 --> 27:28.800
The tribute pearls fraud
involves many parties.

27:30.680 --> 27:33.080
It's not just about Cui family.

27:35.920 --> 27:37.960
There's indeed nobody left in Cui family.

27:38.560 --> 27:40.720
Let me tell you again.

27:40.800 --> 27:42.040
When something went wrong,

27:42.120 --> 27:44.760
it's just the Cui family and no one else.

27:44.840 --> 27:46.560
If you are seeking death,

27:47.080 --> 27:49.880
I'm not going down with you.

27:51.400 --> 27:53.680
A girl will only be girl.

27:54.280 --> 27:56.160
Suit yourself.

27:57.120 --> 27:58.200
We'll go back.

28:03.120 --> 28:05.320
-Xu Nanying.
-You…

28:05.840 --> 28:07.640
Look what you've done.

28:07.720 --> 28:09.120
Father, don't you believe him.

28:09.640 --> 28:11.080
He's on the same boat with us.

28:11.160 --> 28:13.720
He would never dare
spill the truth about the tribute pearls.

28:13.800 --> 28:16.480
Even if he settles this matter this time
for his own sake,

28:17.080 --> 28:18.080
do you think that

28:18.160 --> 28:20.680
he will let the Cui family live?

28:21.280 --> 28:23.440
-But Father, this time--
-Someone,

28:23.520 --> 28:25.360
send Lady Shijiu back to her room.

28:25.440 --> 28:27.200
Don't let her take a step out.

28:27.280 --> 28:28.400
Yes.

28:42.640 --> 28:44.160
Shijiu, get up quickly.

28:44.240 --> 28:45.720
Your father forgave you.

28:46.800 --> 28:47.800
You begged him again.

28:48.320 --> 28:49.680
What is it this time?

28:50.800 --> 28:52.400
The rest of your dowry?

28:52.480 --> 28:54.720
Shijiu, don't worry about these.

28:54.800 --> 28:56.600
-I'm--
-Why?

28:57.480 --> 29:00.360
Mother, you're his real wife.

29:02.240 --> 29:04.240
Is it because I'm a girl?

29:05.720 --> 29:08.560
We have to just swallow everything in
in this house.

29:08.640 --> 29:12.720
Even aunt dares to ride
on your head, Mother.

29:12.800 --> 29:14.040
Shijiu.

29:15.560 --> 29:18.480
I know you've been through a lot.

29:19.160 --> 29:20.960
Don't blame your father.

29:21.040 --> 29:22.480
It's not easy for him either.

29:23.120 --> 29:24.520
It's all for the Cui family.

29:25.480 --> 29:26.520
Mother.

29:27.280 --> 29:30.000
And we can't break the Cui's bloodline.

29:31.160 --> 29:32.120
Fine.

29:35.160 --> 29:36.200
Don't blame Father.

29:39.080 --> 29:39.920
Blame me.

29:47.440 --> 29:48.360
Mother.

29:50.120 --> 29:51.160
I'm telling you.

29:52.720 --> 29:54.080
I, Cui Shijiu,

29:55.080 --> 29:57.840
will make both of us stand
with our heads up in front of Father.

29:57.920 --> 30:00.080
I swear.

30:02.600 --> 30:03.600
Mother.

30:05.720 --> 30:06.840
Why?

30:10.800 --> 30:13.000
I did what I had to do.

30:14.080 --> 30:15.640
I couldn't help Father.

30:17.280 --> 30:18.320
I couldn't save you.

30:21.200 --> 30:22.920
I couldn't save myself either.

30:33.840 --> 30:34.840
Lady Shijiu.

30:35.560 --> 30:36.760
Lady Shijiu.

30:36.840 --> 30:39.000
You have not drink any water today.
Stop drinking.

30:39.080 --> 30:40.520
Can you eat something?

30:42.560 --> 30:44.160
I abandoned it a long time ago.

30:44.240 --> 30:46.920
The reality and stability
of being a woman.

30:47.000 --> 30:48.280
I fought.

30:49.000 --> 30:49.880
I snatched.

30:51.600 --> 30:54.880
I killed a bloody path
out of those bastards.

30:56.720 --> 30:59.280
Got Father's a little attention.

30:59.360 --> 31:02.200
Now how do you expect me
to marry the Zheng family?

31:02.280 --> 31:03.800
How would I be willing to?

31:04.520 --> 31:05.520
Lady Shijiu.

31:06.680 --> 31:08.720
Marrying Zheng Wu, that rake.

31:09.720 --> 31:11.680
Leaning onto the
Zheng family for a lifetime.

31:12.640 --> 31:15.560
Living a sad life in a courtyard.

31:16.080 --> 31:18.360
But after all, it's the Zheng family.

31:18.440 --> 31:20.480
You can still live a stable life there.

31:20.560 --> 31:22.200
But I don't want to.

31:23.200 --> 31:24.160
Tong.

31:24.760 --> 31:26.000
I know.

31:29.600 --> 31:31.360
I grew up in the Zhenlang Pavilion.

31:33.000 --> 31:34.240
I know the ledgers.

31:34.880 --> 31:36.080
I know jewelries.

31:36.680 --> 31:39.160
Am I not better than my brothers?

31:41.600 --> 31:42.760
But why would they be able to

31:42.840 --> 31:45.200
test and error in doing business?

31:46.800 --> 31:48.320
While I had to

31:50.040 --> 31:52.400
hand over the Zhenlang Pavilion to others.

31:53.040 --> 31:56.120
Why do I have to be locked in this room?

32:00.400 --> 32:02.600
I would never want to be like my mother.

32:05.760 --> 32:07.120
I don't want to.

32:07.200 --> 32:08.600
I'm going out.

32:12.040 --> 32:13.120
Help me.

32:14.160 --> 32:15.280
Help me.

32:19.240 --> 32:20.160
Lady Shijiu.

32:21.800 --> 32:23.320
I just heard outside the master's room

32:23.920 --> 32:26.560
that the pearl lotus platform
is on the way here.

32:26.640 --> 32:29.800
It will be sent to Lord Tan at Jingzhong.

32:31.240 --> 32:34.040
When the master goes to the port
to receive the pearl lotus platform

32:34.120 --> 32:35.240
I'll send Lady Shijiu--

32:36.400 --> 32:37.560
No.

32:37.640 --> 32:39.160
I'll send mister out.

32:40.520 --> 32:41.800
Pearl lotus platform.

32:44.920 --> 32:46.000
So

32:46.520 --> 32:47.880
does it mean that

32:48.400 --> 32:49.920
as long as Zhang Jinran has no ledger,

32:50.000 --> 32:53.160
and we find a way
to pay for the compensation,

32:54.160 --> 32:55.800
the Cui family will survive?

32:58.240 --> 32:59.080
Yes.

32:59.600 --> 33:00.480
Good.

33:01.240 --> 33:02.080
Good.

33:14.080 --> 33:15.440
Special Envoy Xu.

33:33.560 --> 33:34.440
Cui Family

33:35.240 --> 33:36.720
is willing to confess
the mistake about the tribute pearls.

33:38.440 --> 33:39.520
We will also prepare
the pearl lotus platform

33:39.600 --> 33:41.080
which will be offered to Lord Tan.

33:42.000 --> 33:44.640
We just hope that Special Envoy Xu
can make the mediation for Cui family.

33:44.720 --> 33:45.560
Just a few days.

33:57.520 --> 33:59.880
I will make sure
Zhang Jinran cannot leave Guangzhou.

34:10.920 --> 34:13.159
Now you know you need to do this.

34:16.040 --> 34:18.560
But why should I trust you?

34:25.239 --> 34:27.239
Because the Cui family
doesn't want to die yet.

34:28.440 --> 34:30.000
Bun.

34:31.560 --> 34:34.320
Freshly baked buns.

34:34.400 --> 34:35.239
Thanks.

34:36.600 --> 34:39.199
Shoot with this.

34:39.280 --> 34:41.120
I want this.

34:41.199 --> 34:42.560
Master, she's here.

34:44.760 --> 34:47.159
Mr. Zhang, what's the matter?

34:49.000 --> 34:51.760
I think you must be interested in
the Hu People's Market.

34:51.840 --> 34:53.000
I want to take you around.

34:55.719 --> 34:56.719
Is there

34:58.160 --> 34:59.440
anything else?

35:00.080 --> 35:01.520
I'm going back to Chang'an tomorrow.

35:02.360 --> 35:03.840
I want to say goodbye to you.

35:05.840 --> 35:07.080
Du Ming.

35:07.160 --> 35:08.440
You go to East Town

35:08.520 --> 35:10.240
and buy me some of my favorite
osmanthus lotus root cakes

35:10.840 --> 35:12.040
Osmanthus lotus root cakes?

35:12.840 --> 35:14.040
When do you start liking
osmanthus lotus root cakes?

35:19.840 --> 35:21.120
But you still have
important things to do.

35:21.800 --> 35:23.120
Don't worry, they can't go wrong.

35:23.720 --> 35:25.600
Come on, let's try one.

35:29.560 --> 35:30.640
It's nice right?

35:34.000 --> 35:35.120
This is candied fruit.

35:35.200 --> 35:36.920
It's sweet and soft. Try it.

35:38.040 --> 35:39.160
Candied fruit?

35:46.800 --> 35:48.600
It's like a coral bead.

35:50.440 --> 35:51.640
-I have something for you.
-Murder!

35:51.720 --> 35:53.240
Move out of the way!

35:53.320 --> 35:54.760
-Out of the way.
-What's wrong?

35:54.840 --> 35:56.560
-Murder!
-Don't run.

35:56.640 --> 35:57.520
-Chase!
-Out of the way. Out of the way.

35:58.120 --> 35:59.240
Help!

36:01.320 --> 36:02.520
Murder!

36:02.600 --> 36:04.720
-Help!
-Mr. Zhang.

36:07.360 --> 36:08.560
-Duanwu.
-Stop running!

36:08.640 --> 36:10.120
-Duanwu!
-Stop!

36:13.520 --> 36:15.280
-Out of the way!
-Stop!

36:15.360 --> 36:16.520
Out of the way. Out of the way.

36:16.600 --> 36:18.840
Out of the way.

36:20.040 --> 36:21.840
-Stop! Don't run!
-Out of the way.

36:22.480 --> 36:23.360
Out of the way.

36:23.440 --> 36:24.280
-What are you doing?
-Stop.

36:30.520 --> 36:31.600
-Out of the way.
-Out of the way.

36:37.800 --> 36:39.120
Stop.

36:46.520 --> 36:47.440
Duanwu. Hurry up.

36:48.640 --> 36:49.680
Let's go.

37:01.440 --> 37:02.480
I asked you out today

37:02.560 --> 37:04.040
but encountered this kind of thing.

37:04.120 --> 37:05.280
I'm sorry about it.

37:06.040 --> 37:07.280
It's nothing, Mr. Zhang.

37:07.800 --> 37:09.720
Who could have predicted
what happened today?

37:10.800 --> 37:12.720
But you were saying that
you want to give me something?

37:13.840 --> 37:15.320
I was in Baniang's room.

37:19.160 --> 37:20.200
Mr. Zhang, be careful.

37:22.360 --> 37:24.280
What a filthy couple.

37:27.400 --> 37:29.400
Despicable pearl slave.

37:30.200 --> 37:31.600
What happened at the pearl fishery,

37:31.680 --> 37:33.000
it's all because of you.

37:33.640 --> 37:35.960
I should have sent you
to the production shed.

37:36.040 --> 37:39.040
To make you suffer every day.

37:39.560 --> 37:41.240
Let the sharks in Duanwang Pond

37:41.320 --> 37:43.400
swallow you alive.

37:46.640 --> 37:47.600
Cui Jia.

38:01.480 --> 38:02.760
And Baniang

38:02.840 --> 38:04.520
betrayed the pearl fishery

38:05.040 --> 38:06.000
because of you.

38:06.600 --> 38:08.280
I really shouldn't have killed her.

38:08.360 --> 38:09.960
I should bring her back

38:10.680 --> 38:11.720
and strip her alive.

38:12.360 --> 38:14.880
Peel her skin and make her suffer.

38:35.200 --> 38:36.240
Cui Jia.

38:38.080 --> 38:39.120
Long time no see.

38:45.200 --> 38:46.280
But in the future,

38:46.360 --> 38:47.960
we'll never see each other again.

38:50.640 --> 38:51.600
Duanwu.

39:06.680 --> 39:09.720
I'll kill you. I will avenge my mother.

39:09.800 --> 39:10.800
I'll kill you.

39:30.360 --> 39:31.320
Duanwu.

39:36.160 --> 39:37.360
Duanwu.

39:37.440 --> 39:38.840
He will surely
be punished for his evil deeds.

39:38.920 --> 39:40.200
He killed my mother!

39:40.280 --> 39:41.800
He killed my mother!

39:41.880 --> 39:43.920
The pearl fishery of the Cui family does
not give enough tribute pearls every year.

39:44.000 --> 39:47.840
If it's exposed, no way they will
get away with it. Listen to me.

39:48.440 --> 39:49.360
Duanwu.

39:49.880 --> 39:52.120
You have to believe
that there is righteousness in this world.

39:56.440 --> 39:57.520
Mr. Zhang.

39:59.400 --> 40:00.600
In this world,

40:01.640 --> 40:03.320
where is righteousness?

40:03.920 --> 40:05.840
Where is righteousness?

40:06.520 --> 40:07.640
Trust me.

40:10.560 --> 40:12.120
I'll catch him.

40:22.120 --> 40:23.160
Don't worry.

40:23.960 --> 40:25.360
They won't get away with it.

40:36.720 --> 40:38.360
Don't be mad, Shijiu Lang.

40:38.440 --> 40:40.640
I-I really didn't expect

40:40.720 --> 40:43.240
that filthy pearl slave is that fierce.

40:45.040 --> 40:46.240
Don't let me catch her.

40:47.000 --> 40:48.640
I'll kill her myself.

40:54.960 --> 40:56.680
Shijiu Lang, don't worry.

40:56.760 --> 40:58.360
I'll catch her myself.

40:59.360 --> 41:00.560
I won't spare her.

41:16.840 --> 41:18.920
Duanwu, you must trust me.

41:20.200 --> 41:22.520
I'm sure I'll bring them all to justice.

41:23.600 --> 41:25.640
Cui's annual tribute pearls
are not enough every year.

41:27.360 --> 41:29.840
And this time in Guangzhou,
they don't have the power to recover.

41:30.560 --> 41:32.000
They won't get away with it.

41:39.280 --> 41:41.120
Previously, in order to gather
more evidence of the Cui's,

41:41.200 --> 41:42.400
I've been to Baniang's room.

41:43.520 --> 41:44.840
I found this.

42:07.880 --> 42:08.720
Thank you, Mr. Zhang.
